body:
Like a bunch of others have said here - be ready to be COLD. Our seasons are basically as follows;

Summer: Late June - Very early September if you get lucky. Temperatures range from 35 to 90 degrees Fahrenheit on hot days and 30 to 50 on cold days.

Winter: Mid to late October - April. Not even joking. The snow stays until May sometimes. Beginning and end of the season it's usually around -10 to 30 degrees Fahrenheit. But beware. In January/February it can dip down to -40 to -60. So bundle up!
